    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: abstract_value_chain_phase_template; entity_description: Abstract Value Chain Phase Template, a product-agnostic value chain phase model aligned with the supply chain template by phase ID. It defines value categories per phase with N-D-C tagging and example metric types. Instances for Gold and Shea exist separately. Time resolution is quarterly and/or annual. The document also references related supply chain template and value chain instances for specific products. Key claim: value chain aligns to supply chain by phase ID. Projects: gold, shea. Tags include pdi, template, value_chain, phase_mapping, ndc. Source role is phase_template. Status active, domain pdi, layer value_chain. Doc ID: abstract_value_chain_phase_template."@en ;
