:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_module_1_anchor_the_chain_entity_description_first_module_of_the_pdi._establishes_the_two_fixed_endpoints_origin_and_market_identifies_units_of_measurement_at_each_end_and_produces_a_first_pass_list_of_all_change_events_and_actors._must_be_completed_before_any_other_module._content_defines_the_material_in_its_pre_commercial_state_a1_and_final_market_delivery_form_a2_records_units_a3_a4_checks_for_unit_changes_a5_lists_all_distinct_physical_forms_a6_and_all_actor_classes_a7._completion_check_verifies_at_least_three_physical_forms_and_three_actor_classes_are_listed
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: module 1: anchor the chain; entity_description: First module of the PDI. Establishes the two fixed endpoints (origin and market), identifies units of measurement at each end, and produces a first-pass list of all change events and actors. Must be completed before any other module. Content: defines the material in its pre-commercial state (A1) and final market delivery form (A2), records units (A3, A4), checks for unit changes (A5), lists all distinct physical forms (A6), and all actor classes (A7). Completion check verifies at least three physical forms and three actor classes are listed."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed 2 times in the knowledge graph."@en ;
    rdfs:domain owl:Thing ;
    rdfs:range owl:Thing .

:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_module_2_event_inventory_entity_description_second_module_of_the_pdi._repeated_once_for_every_candidate_event._an_event_is_anything_that_changes_physical_form_handler_location_process_or_ownership._for_each_event_twelve_questions_b1b12_capture_physical_form_before_after_process_class_custody_ownership_changes_measurability_of_output_and_reasons_for_opacity._generates_scored_records_that_feed_module_3._must_follow_module_1_completion
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: module 2: event inventory; entity_description: Second module of the PDI. Repeated once for every candidate event. An event is anything that changes physical form, handler, location, process, or ownership. For each event, twelve questions (B1–B12) capture physical form before/after, process class, custody/ownership changes, measurability of output, and reasons for opacity. Generates scored records that feed Module 3. Must follow Module 1 completion."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed 2 times in the knowledge graph."@en ;
    rdfs:domain owl:Thing ;
    rdfs:range owl:Thing .

:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_module_3_boundary_scoring_entity_description_third_module_of_the_pdi._applies_the_scoring_rule_to_each_event_record_from_module_2_to_determine_which_events_rise_to_phase_boundaries._produces_a_final_numbered_phase_map_with_documented_boundary_decisions
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: module 3: boundary scoring; entity_description: Third module of the PDI. Applies the scoring rule to each event record from Module 2 to determine which events rise to phase boundaries. Produces a final, numbered phase map with documented boundary decisions."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed 2 times in the knowledge graph."@en ;
    rdfs:domain owl:Thing ;
    rdfs:range owl:Thing .

:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_module_4_opacity_tagging_entity_description_fourth_module_of_the_pdi._answers_four_questions_per_confirmed_phase_to_assign_a_transparency_classification_e.g._informal_practice_commercial_secrecy_physical_inaccessibility._uses_classifications_recorded_in_module_2_question_b12._outputs_a_transparency_rating_for_each_phase
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: module 4: opacity tagging; entity_description: Fourth module of the PDI. Answers four questions per confirmed phase to assign a transparency classification (e.g., informal practice, commercial secrecy, physical inaccessibility). Uses classifications recorded in Module 2 Question B12. Outputs a transparency rating for each phase."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed 2 times in the knowledge graph."@en ;
