:relationship_name_contains_entity_name_phase_discovery_instrument_pdi_entity_description_material_agnostic_supply_chain_phase_mapping_protocol_version_1.0_part_of_the_true_value_analytics_project._status_active_domain_pdi_layer_supply_chain._provides_a_method_to_determine_phase_structure_transparency_ratings_and_boundary_decisions_for_any_material_supply_chain_from_first_principles._consists_of_four_mandatory_sequential_modules_anchor_the_chain_event_inventory_boundary_scoring_and_opacity_tagging._produces_a_numbered_phase_map_with_documented_boundaries_and_a_transparency_rating_per_phase._requires_a_domain_expert_for_one_question_b5_all_other_questions_are_answerable_by_any_analyst_with_chain_documentation._time_to_complete_24_hours_for_a_well_documented_chain_longer_for_opaque_ones._the_instrument_does_not_assume_prior_industry_or_commodity_knowledge_phases_are_outputs_not_inputs
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "relationship_name: contains; entity_name: phase discovery instrument (pdi); entity_description: Material-Agnostic Supply Chain Phase Mapping Protocol, version 1.0, part of the True Value Analytics project. Status: active, domain: pdi, layer: supply_chain. Provides a method to determine phase structure, transparency ratings, and boundary decisions for any material supply chain from first principles. Consists of four mandatory sequential modules: Anchor the Chain, Event Inventory, Boundary Scoring, and Opacity Tagging. Produces a numbered phase map with documented boundaries and a transparency rating per phase. Requires a domain expert for one question (B5); all other questions are answerable by any analyst with chain documentation. Time to complete: 2–4 hours for a well-documented chain, longer for opaque ones. The instrument does not assume prior industry or commodity knowledge; phases are outputs, not inputs."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed 2 times in the knowledge graph."@en ;
    rdfs:domain owl:Thing ;
    rdfs:range owl:Thing .

